      "message": "Tom, this forces CMake to look for `clang` binary in `/usr/bin`. The `TOOLCHAIN_HOME` variable is used in a [Zephyr compiler script](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/cmake/compiler/clang/target.cmake;l\u003d14-19;drc\u003d779018f2eda4eb8617046d628fec2ba2a0919cc0).\n\nIf you have some questions, please let me know.",
      "revId": "3894a14d849cdace98bfcef678e505ae1400c5fe",
